// 289's player/scripts/consumption/nightshade.rs2. 2011's cave nightshade
// (2398, 289's nightshade) has Eat on op4 (cache 786 iop4; 289's had it on
// op2). 289's 15 hitpoints are 2011's 150 life points: 2011 wiki, Cave
// nightshade (2011-04-06), "this causes 150 life points of damage", with the
// same two messages and "Ahhhh! What have I done!".
[opheld4,cave_nightshade]
inv_delslot(inv, last_slot);
mes("You eat the nightshade...");
mes("The nightshade was highly poisonous.");
queue(damage_player, 0, 150);
~chatplayer("<p,angry>Ahhhh! What have I done!");
